{%- layout none -%}
{%- comment -%} French Avenue Landingpage "Une avenue, huit adresses". Szenen fa-s-*.jpg, Vorschauen fa-t-<handle>.webp, Share-Bild fa-og.jpg. Produkte live aus Kollektion french-avenue (verfügbar, ohne Fragrance World und Taurus-90-ml-Duplikat). Claude 21.11.2026 {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign fa_l = request.locale.iso_code | slice: 0, 2 -%}
{%- assign fa_col = collections['french-avenue'] -%}
{%- if routes.root_url == '/' -%}{%- assign fa_shop = '/products/' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign fa_shop = routes.root_url | append: '/products/' -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- capture fa_t -%}{% case fa_l %}{% when "en" %}French Avenue Perfume – One Avenue, Eight Addresses | Black Elixir{% when "fr" %}Parfum French Avenue – Une avenue, huit adresses | Black Elixir{% when "it" %}Profumo French Avenue – Un viale, otto indirizzi | Black Elixir{% when "da" %}French Avenue parfume – Én avenue, otte adresser | Black Elixir{% when "ar" %}عطور فرنش أفنيو – شارع واحد، ثمانية عناوين | بلاك إليكسير{% when "he" %}בושם פרנץ' אווניו – שדרה אחת, שמונה כתובות | Black Elixir{% else %}French Avenue Parfum – Eine Avenue, acht Adressen | Black Elixir{% endcase %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture fa_d -%}{% case fa_l %}{% when "en" %}French Avenue perfume at Black Elixir: Genesis Taurus and Aries, An Equestrian Series Pierce and Haydan, Royal Blend, Pinnace Noir, Meringue, Sweet Paradise and more – a walk down the avenue.{% when "fr" %}Parfums French Avenue chez Black Elixir : Genesis Taurus et Aries, An Equestrian Series Pierce et Haydan, Royal Blend, Pinnace Noir, Meringue, Sweet Paradise et plus – une promenade sur l'avenue.{% when "it" %}Profumi French Avenue da Black Elixir: Genesis Taurus e Aries, An Equestrian Series Pierce e Haydan, Royal Blend, Pinnace Noir, Meringue, Sweet Paradise e altri – una passeggiata lungo il viale.{% when "da" %}French Avenue parfume hos Black Elixir: Genesis Taurus og Aries, An Equestrian Series Pierce og Haydan, Royal Blend, Pinnace Noir, Meringue, Sweet Paradise og flere – en tur ned ad avenuen.{% when "ar" %}عطور French Avenue لدى بلاك إليكسير: Genesis Taurus وAries، وAn Equestrian Series Pierce وHaydan، وRoyal Blend وPinnace Noir وMeringue وSweet Paradise وغيرها – نزهة على طول الشارع.{% when "he" %}בשמי French Avenue ב-Black Elixir: Genesis Taurus ו-Aries, An Equestrian Series Pierce ו-Haydan, Royal Blend, Pinnace Noir, Meringue, Sweet Paradise ועוד – טיול לאורך השדרה.{% else %}French Avenue Parfum bei Black Elixir: Genesis Taurus und Aries, An Equestrian Series Pierce und Haydan, Royal Blend, Pinnace Noir, Meringue, Sweet Paradise und mehr – ein Spaziergang über die Avenue.{% endcase %}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign fa_og = images['fa-og.jpg'] -%}
{%- paginate fa_col.products by 100 -%}
