<main id="chapters"><section class="ch" id="n1"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['fa-s-haydan.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['fa-s-haydan.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="French Avenue An Equestrian Series Haydan – Le matin · manège" width="1800" height="1195"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="plate" aria-label="N° 3"><span>N° 3</span></div><div class="place" lang="fr">Manège</div><div class="time">Le matin · manège</div><p class="mean fade">La lumière du matin tombe par les fenêtres cintrées sur le sable. Ici vit le flacon vert de l'Equestrian Series.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>French Avenue An Equestrian Series Haydan</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['french-avenue-an-equestrian-series-haydan-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ fa_shop }}french-avenue-an-equestrian-series-haydan-eau-de-parfum">Voir le parfum</a></div></div></section><section class="ch" id="n2"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['fa-s-meringue.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['fa-s-meringue.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="French Avenue Meringue – Midi" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="plate" aria-label="N° 7"><span>N° 7</span></div><div class="place" lang="fr">Salon de thé</div><div class="time">Midi</div><p class="mean fade">Marbre, pastels et porcelaine fine – et un flacon qui porte le nom de la meringue.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>French Avenue Meringue</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['french-avenue-meringue-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ fa_shop }}french-avenue-meringue-eau-de-parfum">Voir le parfum</a></div></div></section><section class="ch" id="n3"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['fa-s-paradise.jpg'] |