<main id="chapters"><section class="ch" id="n1"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['fa-s-haydan.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['fa-s-haydan.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="French Avenue An Equestrian Series Haydan – Mattino · maneggio" width="1800" height="1195"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="plate" aria-label="N° 3"><span>N° 3</span></div><div class="place" lang="fr">Manège</div><div class="time">Mattino · maneggio</div><p class="mean fade">La luce del mattino entra dalle finestre ad arco sulla sabbia. Qui vive il flacone verde della Equestrian Series.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>French Avenue An Equestrian Series Haydan</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['french-avenue-an-equestrian-series-haydan-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ fa_shop }}french-avenue-an-equestrian-series-haydan-eau-de-parfum">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch" id="n2"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['fa-s-meringue.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['fa-s-meringue.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="French Avenue Meringue – Mezzogiorno · sala da tè" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="plate" aria-label="N° 7"><span>N° 7</span></div><div class="place" lang="fr">Salon de thé</div><div class="time">Mezzogiorno · sala da tè</div><p class="mean fade">Marmo, colori pastello e porcellana fine – e un flacone che porta il nome della meringa.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>French Avenue Meringue</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['french-avenue-meringue-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ fa_shop }}french-avenue-meringue-eau-de-parfum">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch" id="n3"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['fa-s-paradise.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['fa-s-paradise.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="French Avenue Sweet Paradise – Tardo pomeriggio · giardino d'inverno" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="plate" aria-label="N° 12"><span>N° 12</span></div><div class="place" lang="fr">Jardin d'hiver</div><div class="time">Tardo pomeriggio · giardino d'inverno</div><p class="mean fade">Sotto vetro e palme, ancora caldo dell'ultima luce del giorno.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>French Avenue Sweet Paradise</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['french-avenue-sweet-paradise-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ fa_shop }}french-avenue-sweet-paradise-eau-de-parfum">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch" id="n4"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['fa-s-pierce.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['fa-s-pierce.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="French Avenue An Equestrian Series Pierce – Sera · selleria" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="plate" aria-label="N° 21"><span>N° 21</span></div><div class="place" lang="fr">Sellerie</div><div class="time">Sera · selleria</div><p class="mean fade">Tra selle e fibbie d'ottone c'è Pierce, il flacone giallo della Equestrian Series.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>French Avenue An Equestrian Series Pierce</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['french-avenue-an-equestrian-series-pierce-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ fa_shop }}french-avenue-an-equestrian-series-pierce-eau-de-parfum">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch" id="n5"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['fa-s-pinnace.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"