 alt="French Avenue Genesis Aries – Notte · sui tetti" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="plate" aria-label="N° 52"><span>N° 52</span></div><div class="place" lang="fr">Sur les toits</div><div class="time">Notte · sui tetti</div><p class="mean fade">Lassù, tra tetti di zinco e comignoli, al chiaro di luna: Aries, l'ariete.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>French Avenue Genesis Aries</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['french-avenue-genesis-aries-eau-de-parfum'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ fa_shop }}french-avenue-genesis-aries-eau-de-parfum">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section><section class="ch" id="n8"><div class="stage"><picture><source media="(max-width:760px)" srcset="{{ images['fa-s-royal.jpg'] | image_url: width: 900 }}"><img src="{{ images['fa-s-royal.jpg'] | image_url: width: 1800 }}" alt="French Avenue Royal Blend – Notte fonda · club privato" width="1800" height="1195" fetchpriority="low"></picture><div class="veil"></div><div class="txt"><div class="plate" aria-label="N° 88"><span>N° 88</span></div><div class="place" lang="fr">Club privé</div><div class="time">Notte fonda · club privato</div><p class="mean fade">Lacca nera, velluto rosso, una sola lampada. Royal Blend nel cristallo intagliato.</p><div class="prod fade"><b>French Avenue Royal Blend</b><span class="pr">{{ all_products['french-avenue-royal-blend-edp'].price | money }}</span></div><a class="btn fade" href="{{ fa_shop }}french-avenue-royal-blend-edp">Scopri il profumo</a></div></div></section></main>
